---
import { supportGuides } from "./supportGuides";
---
<section>
  <div
    class="mx-auto w-full lg:px-24 max-w-7xl md:px-12 items-center px-8 py-24">
    <div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[40rem] pt-20 pb-24">
        <h1
          class="text-4xl tracking-tight font-medium text-black md:text-5xl font-display">
          Support
        </h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[40rem] pb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black font-display">Guides</h2>
      <ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {supportGuides.map((guide) => (
          <li>
            <a href={guide.href} class="block h-full rounded-2xl border border-black/5 bg-zinc-50 p-5 hover:border-pink-300 hover:bg-pink-50">
              <span class="font-medium text-black">{guide.title}</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-gray-500">{guide.summary}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="mx-auto max-w-[40rem] text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black font-display">Get in touch</h2>
      <div class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[40rem] prose-base prose text-gray-500 prose-h3:text-black prose-a:font-semibold prose-a:text-pink-500 hover:prose-a:text-black">
        <p>As much as we try to make BeautyMark perfect, pesky bugs sometimes slip through the cracks. 
          But don't worry, our team is always on the case to squash those little 
          troublemakers as quickly as possible! 🔧🐛
        </p>
        <p>
          If you spot any misbehaving features or just have some feedback to share, 
          give us a shout at <a href="mailto:support@beautymark.app">support@beautymark.app</a>. 
          You can also swing by our <a href="https://discord.gg/beautymark">Discord server</a> to 
          let us know what's up and connect with other beauty aficionados.
        </p>
        <p>Thanks for your patience and understanding as we work to make BeautyMark the best it can be. 💖
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
